@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

# Position + route data come from the free adsb.lol API (no credentials);
# see docs/configuration.md. Aircraft include originAirport/originCountry and
# destinationAirport/destinationCountry, plus destinationEnrichment.

### Fly-overs over a location (near CDG) — aircraft include origin and
### destination airports/countries, plus destinationEnrichment on the result
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fly-overs?lat=48.8566&lng=2.3522&radiusKm=50

### Invalid coordinates -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fly-overs?lat=999&lng=2.3522&radiusKm=50

### Invalid radius -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fly-overs?lat=48.8566&lng=2.3522&radiusKm=-1

### Missing parameter -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fly-overs?lat=48.8566&radiusKm=50

### Empty area (open ocean) -> 200, count 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fly-overs?lat=0&lng=0&radiusKm=20

### Feed unavailable -> 502/503 (e.g. run with an unreachable ADSB_BASE_URL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fly-overs?lat=48.8566&lng=2.3522&radiusKm=50